From ae3f0989f3fa1bd0572ca86485782fc8304231a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 14:24:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: stm32/hash - increase HASH driver priority
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Since the HASH block is a hardware peripheral that is intentionally
enabled, its priority should be higher than other drivers.
Increase its priority to 301.

Change-Id: Iad38894c7a28e3b58da8de475aaa5b7cd73d6c83
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 drivers/crypto/stm32/stm32-hash.c | 40 +++++++++++++++----------------
 1 file changed, 20 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/crypto/stm32/stm32-hash.c b/drivers/crypto/stm32/stm32-hash.c
index a5f599d85466..08b51ac7ab7e 100644
